@sagitt 
I have a WIP PR that converts the integration to use [DataUpdateCoordinator](https://developers.home-assistant.io/docs/integration_fetching_data/) as suggested in #82771. By default the update interval will stay at 60 seconds, but you will be able to set up automation rules to trigger the `update_entity` service at whatever frequency you like (well, technically >5s due to debouncer setup). 

[The branch](https://github.com/yuxincs/core/tree/apcupsd-coordinated-sensor-rewrite) is ready, but I'm waiting for #85967 to get merged first before creating another PR.
